# Wojek Investigator: "At the beginning of your upkeep, investigate once for each opponent who has more cards in hand than you."
# Bot1 casts three free Mox Pearls and Wojek on turn 1, leaving 3 cards in hand at its turn-3 upkeep (the draw comes after); Bot2 plays
# nothing and holds 7 (it discards its eighth card at cleanup). One opponent with more cards means one Clue (a colorless artifact
# token) on turn 3; Bot1 then has 4 cards in hand after drawing.

